      "statement": "The aspen theme is customized with TWK Lausanne (weight 700) for headings loaded via docs.json, additional font weights declared in /src/style.css via @font-face rules, and Inter for body text. Custom CSS in /src/style.css overrides Mintlify defaults and is injected into page headers via docs.json.",
